  unitName: Thunder Kick Zeln
  unitId: 40143
  unitNumber: 214
  description: "A fighter hailing from the Republic of Atalva who trained at the
    Toltya Dojo in the Sama Kingdom. After completing his training, Zeln set out
    on a journey to look for Nemia while continuing to hone his skills. He followed
    tales of Nemia\u2019s exploits across the land, leaving a trail of humbled challengers
    in his wake. It\u2019s said that he rescued Nemia from the jaws of death while
    fighting the gods in Sama, but whether this is true or not is a matter for debate."
  summonDesc: Summoner!<br>Can you cure people of their regrets?<br>If so, my power
    is yours to command.
  fusionDesc: Come to me, power! Forge my body into a blade capable of saving the
    one I love!
  evoDesc: Say hello to my evolved form! This is the true face of the Lightning King.
  element: 4
  rarity: 3
